"P1119094506" "With the Eye back in Arachnos' hands, we now need to destroy the list. The central computer where the list is stored is in Mercy Island, so you will need to venture there. Once in the base you will need to take down everyone there. You can't be tied to this operation in any way. Once you have access to the computer, you will need to destroy the list, and any local copies. Then you will need to find the security computer and erase everything on that so that you can escape."
// AcceptString :
"P409235279" "Destroy the Destined One list"
// SendOffString :
"P3527282349" "This sounds easy, but I heard that there were some upper level Arachnos guards protecting it."
