"P1201199958" "As you remember, Alan had a virus that added your name to all the Lists that were on the Arachnos network. Eventually the IT guys at Arachnos found and disabled that virus, so you will need to get a new one from Alan and then put it on an Arachnos mainframe. This new virus will destroy all the lists, while making it look like a Longbow operation."
