"P615690601" "I hope things with you and Fortunata Hamilton are working out better than they did with Johnson. I am sorry about that by the way. I'm making sure he gets 'dealt with' in a very personal way. As for your needs, I have here a new version of the virus that will seek out and delete all versions of the Destined One list. Take this to an Arachnos base and plant it in a computer there. Then Kalinda will be forced to re-divine the Destined One list. We will see then whether or not you are really on it."

